Which would be an acceptable synonym of the word 'hospitality'?
Solve hospitality mane atidheta ba antikhe adar yatra kora. Tahi ekantar apshan 'A' hi hospitality shandhir stithik synonym;
kenona welcome-mano swagat jananole ba apaayan korra.

